window.products.push({"id":1181057,"name":"Archos 80 G9 8GB - Classic","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zeFPd+ATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Because it's an ARCHOS device your ARCHOS 80 G9 comes with tailor made Video and Music apps bringing Full HD video, more codec support, jackets and meta-data for your videos, and those extra ARCHOS touches like full screen mirroring and streaming your media over your home wifi network. Amazon.com From the Manufacturer The Archos 80 G9 tablet computer makes it easy to enjoy movies, photos, and other digital media as well as stay connected. A powerful 1.0 GHz dual-core processor helps web pages load faster, while the large 1,024-by-768-pixel screen displays websites at their full width, so there's no need for you to zoom in or out. The device runs Android 3.2 Honeycomb and is Flash compatible, so you can experience the Internet exactly like you would on a PC. Other features include custom email and social networking applications for keeping in touch with friends and family members. ARCHOS 80 G9 Classic 8 GB At a Glance: Fast 1.0 GHz dual-core processor Fast 1.0 GHz dual-core processor 8-inch multi-touch capacitive screen 8-inch multi-touch capacitive screen Android 3.2 Honeycomb operating system Android 3.2 Honeycomb operating system Full HD 1080p video playback Full HD 1080p video playback 720p front camera for HD video chats 720p front camera for HD video chats One-year limited warranty One-year limited warranty 8-inch capacitive multi-touch screen is ideal for movies, photos, and other digital media. View larger . Make video calls using the Google Talk application. View larger . Play the latest Android-based 3D video games. View larger . Integrated kickstand for easy tabletop viewing. View Larger . Powerful Dual-Core Processor Thanks to a 1.0 GHz OMAP 4 dual-core processor from Texas Instruments, the Archos 80 G9 allows you to multitask and surf the web at greater speeds--as well as play the latest Android-based 3D video games. It also smoothly plays full HD 1080p videos at over 30 frames per second. Android Honeycomb for On-the-Go Performance The Archos 80 G9 runs Google's Android 3.2 Honeycomb operating system, which was specially designed and optimized for tablets, and supports Adobe Flash 10.3 for online Flash videos and games. The tablet also includes Google's suite of mobile applications, including Gmail, Maps, and Calendar. HD Video Chatting Equipped with a 720p front camera, the Archos 80 G9 enables you to make video calls using the Google Talk application. Whether it's a one-to-one video chat with an Android smartphone or PC user, this tablet is designed for times when you want to be face to face. Pre-Installed Multimedia Apps The Archos 80 G9 comes installed with video and music applications that offer full HD video, codec support, jackets and meta data for videos, full screen mirroring, and the ability to stream media over your home Wi-Fi network. Technical Specifications and Warranty The Archos 80 G9 offers an 8-inch touchscreen, 8 GB of flash memory, a screen resolution of 1,024 by 768 pixels, and up to seven hours of video playback time. The device measures 8.9 by 6.11 by 0.46 inches (H x W x D) and weighs 17 ounces. The Archos 80 G9 is backed by a one-year limited warranty. What's in the Box Archos 80 G9, standard USB cable, power adapter, and quick start guide. ANDROID TABLETS ARCHOS 80 G9 Classic8 GB ARCHOS 80 G9 Turbo16 GB ARCHOS 80 G9 Turbo250 GB ARCHOS 101 G9 Classic8 GB ARCHOS 101 G9 Turbo16 GB ARCHOS 101 G9 Turbo250 GB Screen Size8 inches8 inches8 inches10.1 inches10.1 inches10.1 inchesScreen Resolution1024 x 7681024 x 7681024 x 7681280 x 8001280 x 8001280 x 800Storage Capacity8 GB Flash Memory16 GB Flash Memory250 GB HDD Memory8 GB Flash Memory16 GB Flash Memory250 GB HDD MemoryProcessor Speed1 GHz1.2 - 1.5 GHz1.2 - 1.5 GHz1 GHz1.2 - 1.5 GHz1.2 - 1.5 GHzOperating SystemANDROID 3.2 (HONEYCOMB)ANDROID 3.2 (HONEYCOMB)ANDROID 3.2 (HONEYCOMB)ANDROID 3.2 (HONEYCOMB)ANDROID 3.2 (HONEYCOMB)ANDROID 3.2 (HONEYCOMB)Android MarketYesYesYesYesYesYesGPSYesYesYesYesYesYesCamera720p720p720p720p720p720p See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zeFPd+ATL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Archos","source_asin":"B005MED31W","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181057","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005MED31W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B005MED31W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
