window.products.push({"id":1181210,"name":"BUSOHE Cat6 Ethernet Cable 75 FT White, Cat-6 Flat RJ45 Computer Internet LAN Network Ethernet Patch Cable Cord, Faster Than Cat5e/Cat5, RJ45 LAN Wire","category":"electronics","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zx8FgsuuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Slim and Flat Profile This network cable is really thin and bends so much easier than round ones. Its flat nature lets you run this wire perfectly through the wall, along the floor, around the door frame, or under carpets and rugs. It is quite durable while also being flexible enough to wrap around a corner. Built for Speed and Reliable Connectivity The Internet cable is capable of transmitting data at speeds of up to 1.0 Gbps with increased transmission frequencies of up to 250 MHz. It is constructed with 4 twisted pairs (UTP) of copper wires, with RJ45 connectors at both ends of the cable. Compared to the Cat 5e patch cord, the more stringent specifications and improved quality in twisting of the wires provide better protection from crosstalk, noise, and interference. Wide Compatibility Supports most devices with RJ45 jacks, including computers, routers, switch boxes, network printers, modems, smart TVs, PS3, PS4, Xbox One, Xbox 360 and more; Backwards compatible with Cat5 & Cat5e. Buy with Confidence All BUSOHE Ethernet cords come with a 30-day money-back guarantee for any reason and 18-month warranty for quality-related issues. Specifications: Type: Cat-6 4-Pair UTP Bandwidth: 250MHz Data Transfer Speed: 1Gbps Conductors: Stranded Bare Copper Connectors: Gold-Plated RJ45 (8P8C) Wiring Standard: 568B RoHS: Confirmed Jacket Material: PVC Width: 0.24in (6mm) Thickness: 0.06in (1.5mm) Package Included: 1 x BUSOHE Cat6 Patch Cable - 75 Feet White 30 x FREE Cable Clips (more or less) Note: Your network speed is determined by many factors, including the cable, your modem, router, other network components, and Internet Service Provider (ISP).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zx8FgsuuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUSOHE","source_asin":"B0BYSPL9JF","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181210","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYSPL9JF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYSPL9JF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
