window.products.push({"id":1181263,"name":"EMTEC C400 Candy II Series 32 GB USB 2.0 Flash Drive (Blue)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DmQDSbTsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description The EMTEC C400 Candy USB Flash Drive offers a stylish update on the classic, entry-level form factor of the C250 series. Each capacity features a different color brightly displayed on a translucent casing. The cap can be attached to the back of the flash drive, like a pen, so you will never lose the cap. Also available in 2GB, 4GB, 8GB, 16GB and 64GB storage capacities. From the Manufacturer In a world full of bland, boring flash drives, EMTEC stands out from the crowd. In today's digital world, consumers are creative and demand advanced technologies to express themselves. EMTEC answers the call by providing a wide range of USB flash drives, each one perfect for storing, transporting and sharing your presentations, documents, photos, music files and more. The EMTEC C400 Candy II USB Flash Drive offers a stylish update to a classic, entry-level form factor. Each capacity features a different color brightly displayed on a translucent casing. The cap can be clipped on the back of the flash drive while it's in use, just like a pen. Also available in 2GB, 4GB, 8GB, 16GB and 64GB capacities. The EMTEC C400 USB Flash Drive is as bright and shiny as a piece of candy! Each capacity features a different color. Features Style - The C400 USB Flash Drive features a classic, entry-level form factor, bright bold color and a translucent casing. The cap can be stored on the back of the drive while it's in use. Style - The C400 USB Flash Drive features a classic, entry-level form factor, bright bold color and a translucent casing. The cap can be stored on the back of the drive while it's in use. Plug and Play - Simply plug the flash drive into your computer's USB port and the computer will automatically detect the device. Plug and Play - Simply plug the flash drive into your computer's USB port and the computer will automatically detect the device. Compatibility - Compatible with most Windows and Mac Operating Systems. Driverless in Windows 2000, XP, Vista and 7. Compatible with all USB 1.1 and USB 2.0 devices. Compatibility - Compatible with most Windows and Mac Operating Systems. Driverless in Windows 2000, XP, Vista and 7. Compatible with all USB 1.1 and USB 2.0 devices. Capacity - The EMTEC C400 Flash Drive is available in 6 storage capacities: 2GB, 4GB, 8GB, 16GB, 32GB and 64GB. Please note: for flash media devices, 1 megabyte = 1 million bytes; 1 gigabyte = 1 billion bytes. Actual useable capacity may vary. Some of the listed capacity may be used for formatting and other functions and thus is not available for data storage. Capacity - The EMTEC C400 Flash Drive is available in 6 storage capacities: 2GB, 4GB, 8GB, 16GB, 32GB and 64GB. Please note: for flash media devices, 1 megabyte = 1 million bytes; 1 gigabyte = 1 billion bytes. Actual useable capacity may vary. Some of the listed capacity may be used for formatting and other functions and thus is not available for data storage. Performance - The C400 Flash Drive features read speeds of up to 15 MB/s and write speeds of up to 8 MB/s. Performance - The C400 Flash Drive features read speeds of up to 15 MB/s and write speeds of up to 8 MB/s. Product Specifications Capacity - 32 GB Capacity - 32 GB Style - Blue Style - Blue Approximate Dimensions - 2.24 x 0.75 x 0.35 in. (L x W x D) Approximate Dimensions - 2.24 x 0.75 x 0.35 in. (L x W x D) Read Speed - up to 15 MB/s Read Speed - up to 15 MB/s Write Speed - up to 8 MB/s Write Speed - up to 8 MB/s Compatibility - Compatible with most Windows and Mac Operating Systems. Compatible with all USB 1.1 and USB 2.0 devices. Compatibility - Compatible with most Windows and Mac Operating Systems. Compatible with all USB 1.1 and USB 2.0 devices. About EMTEC The EMTEC brand was launched from a division of BASF, a pioneer in the media industry. Turning the brand's focus to mobile storage products in the late nineties, EMTEC became a huge success in Europe. Today, EMTEC prides itself in creating innovative products that embody the human spirit: to preserve, protect and share the most valuable moments of daily life. EMTEC designs, develops, manufactures and markets consumer electronic products that are both secure and stylish. EMTEC offers a wide range of products, including USB flash drives, memory cards and other computer-related accessories. It's as simple as a click: you can store, carry and transfer files quickly and easily with an EMTEC flash drive. Whether you are looking for an entry-level, mid-range, premium or fashion flash drive, there is an EMTEC product for you. Explore the range of EMTEC flash drives on Amazon.com or www.EMTECelectronics.com.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DmQDSbTsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emtec","source_asin":"B004NIG5PO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181263","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004NIG5PO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B004NIG5PO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
