window.products.push({"id":1181398,"name":"TuneBand for iPod nano 4th Generation (Model A1285, No Rear Camera), Premium Armband, Compatible with Nike+iPod, BLACK","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7109+uIyoEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The TuneBand for iPod nano 4th Generation provides a comfortable way to wear your device while running, working out, working in the yard, or walking around the block. It features a protective silicone skin that allows access to all ports and buttons, and a soft, elastic strap that fits most arms. NOTE: This TuneBand is designed to work with a bare iPod nano 4th Generation *only*. You may have success installing our silicone skin over an existing iPod nano case, but this use is unsupported by us. Also, if the included elastic strap is either too long or too short, then please contact us at support [at] grantwoodtechnology [dot] com to arrange a replacement strap. We also mention this in the included thank-you card. NOTE: If you are unsure which iPod nano model you own, then please look for a model number on the back of the device. It starts with \"A\", like \"A1234\", and appears in very small print. The iPod nano 4th Generation has a model number of A1285 . Looking for a TuneBand for the other iPod nano models , like the new 7th/8th Generation (A1446), 5th Generation (A1320), 3rd Generation (A1236), 2nd Generation (A1199), or 1st Generation (A1137)? Please search for \"grantwood tuneband ipod nano\" and click on the appropriate listing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7109+uIyoEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grantwood Technology","source_asin":"B001IJTYVS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181398","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001IJTYVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B001IJTYVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
