window.products.push({"id":1181582,"name":"MEILAN Finder GPS Bike Computer Turn-by-Turn Navigation Cycling Computer Bluetooth Support Connect with Cadence Sensor/HR Monitor","category":"electronics","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mCFm13X2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【GPS Real-time Navigation】With GPS satellites, you can navigate in real time using Finder. When the Finder is connected to the Komoot app, you can plan the route you are going to ride in komoot and display the navigation arrows in the Finder. But Finder doesn't support offline maps. Built-in high-sensitivity GPS chip, it supports three systems: BEIDOU, GPS, GLONASS , fast achieve global positioning. First time positioning will take more than 2 minutes, please make sure you are outdoor. 【Data Upload and synchronization】With the MEILAN app, you can easily set up Finder on your phone and upload cycling data and tracks to your phone for clear viewing. Synchronize data and tracks to third-party apps, Automatically share your activities to authorized Strava, Komoot and TrainingPeaks automatically, And share your activities to Facebook by user sharing. You can also upload .Fit files to Strava, Komoot and TrainingPeak via USB cable on your PC. 【Customize Data Display】M1 supports display of up to 48 kinds of data: riding time, speed, cadence, heart rate, power, altitude, slope, cumulative rise, longitude and latitude, heading, left power, right power, etc. you can change the type of data you want to display in the settings, you can also use the up and down shortcut keys on the right to switch the size of the display window, so that important data can be displayed more clearly. 【Bluetooth4.0 & ANT+ sensor compatibility】It can be used with multiple sensors via bluetooth and ANT+, heart rate band, speed, cadence sensor, power meter. To obtain more and more accurate data, know all the data of your riding, so as to plan your exercise plan reasonably. 【LARGE SCREEN DISPLAY】Simplified and backlight design with 2.6” display that’s crisp and easy to read in sunlight or low-light conditions. Waterproof IPX5. If you are not satisfied with our product received, you can apply for unconditional return and refund within 30 days. If you have any questions, please contact us at the first time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mCFm13X2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEILAN","source_asin":"B07QFLHMNX","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181582","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QFLHMNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QFLHMNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
