window.products.push({"id":1181632,"name":"Escort Passport 8500ci Plus","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k8T4L1iwL._AC_.jpg","description":"We've all driven a little faster than we should have at one point or another. Some of us drive a little faster than we should more often than others so a lower end Radar detector just isn't going to cut it. False alarms or warnings that come on too Late are going to lead to expensive tickets and worse than that, you've invested in a product that doesn't work as well as it should. Isn't it time you stepped up to something better that's guaranteed to work all the time, every time? then it's time to check out the Escort 8500ci Plus. The ultimate in vehicle protection. The all new Passport 8500ci Plus provides the ultimate in discreet operation. All sensors are mounted in the front grill and rear license plate area of your vehicle. Interior control module and display are separated for Multiple installation options. The result is No messy cords or unwanted attention. Passport comes preloaded with thousands of safety camera locations, including Red light and fixed position speed cameras located throughout North America. Updates will also be available through the Escort website and you can even set your own Hot spots by using the \"Mark location\" feature. Once marked, the 8500ci Plus will provide a unique alert so you're never caught off Guard.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k8T4L1iwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Escort","source_asin":"B005DUJHGA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181632","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005DUJHGA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B005DUJHGA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
