window.products.push({"id":1181700,"name":"Griffin Technologies PowerWave","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FFBJBCC1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description PowerWave USB audio adapter From the Manufacturer The PowerWave USB audio interface and desktop amplifier is a powerful and extremely flexible computer audio tool that lets you record using the mic or line input directly into your computer. With the PowerWave, listeners can convert their entire LP or cassette collection into CD or MP3 formats, or they can connect a mic or a music instrument and turn their computers into recording studios. Thanks to the PowerWave's integrated desktop amplifier technology, listeners can also connect any set of home speakers to the device and enjoy high-quality audio through their computer's music software. The PowerWave also excels as a compact standalone amp for your iPod or MP3 player, in addition to enabling the user of Apple Pro speakers with any USB-enabled computer. There are a variety of reasons why PowerWave is preferable to the built-in audio on existing PCs or Macs. The inside of your computer produces high-frequency noise that can degrade a computer's audio input and output quality. The PowerWave's USB audio, on the other hand, provides a far cleaner and more effective way of getting sound in and out of the computer. Because the PowerWave's audio A/D and D/A circuitry is outside the computer, it's nowhere near your computer's noisy electronic circuitry. All signals are instead carried to and from your computer digitally through the USB connection. The net effect is audio quality that is far superior to the computer audio to which most people are accustomed. The Griffin PowerWave builds upon this advantage by using the best USB audio codec (compressor/de-compressor) available--the same one used in professional USB audio solutions that cost five to 10 times as much. Further, software available only for the PowerWave allows you to customize your audio input and output levels far more than with many high-end products. The PowerWave incorporates standard RCA stereo and mini-jack connections, which eliminate potential problems caused by outdated proprietary hardware such as the older Macintosh PlainTalk design. By adhering to both the worldwide computer standard 1/8-inch ports and standard stereo RCA connectors, PowerWave guarantees you'll be able to connect peripherals from around the globe. The PowerWave also ensures hassle-free expansion, especially as many new Mac and PC desktop and portable computers now ship without audio inputs. With the PowerWave, you can easily move one piece of equipment between two or more computers. Simply unplug the device from your desktop machine and plug it into your laptop. There are no drivers to install, you don't lose any expansion ports, you don't waste time prying open the case and swapping cards, and perhaps most significantly, you don't face any additional expense. What's in the Box PowerWave, AC power supply, speaker breakout cable, 6-foot stereo mini-jack male to RCA male cable, 7-inch stereo mini-jack male to RCA female cable, USB male A to B cable, software CD-ROM, user's manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FFBJBCC1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Intel","source_asin":"B00008LDHX","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181700","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00008LDHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00008LDHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
