window.products.push({"id":1181766,"name":"Zoom H8 8-Input / 12-Track Portable Handy Recorder with 128GB Pro Memory Card & Wide-Mouth Case Bundle","category":"electronics","retail price":384.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YpIcDB2nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"With three app-driven modes that instantly configure the color touchscreen for podcasting, music production, or location recording, the Zoom H8 Bundle portable handheld recorder lets you quickly record up to eight simultaneous input signals via a workflow that's highly optimized for your task. Plus, it's compatible with an array of capsules (available separately) for easy expansion into 10-input recording, Ambisonics 360-degree audio, and more. Like other H-Series Handy recorders such as the H5 and H6, you can hold the H8 in your hand, attach it to a mic stand or tripod, or mount it to a camera (shoe mount available separately); the H8 packs an impressive array of features into a lightweight body that's more than ready to meet the varied demands of podcasters, musicians, sound designers, and content creators. The bundled Cubase LE and WaveLab Cast software programs give you the tools you need to edit, refine, export, and upload your projects. From the intuitive, tactile controls to the plentiful battery life and powerful audio processing functions, the H8 is well equipped for producing pristine audio for complete musical arrangements, independent films, and panel podcasts. This bundle includes a 128GB Extreme PRO UHS-I SDXC Memory Card a capacity of 128GB, is compatible with the UHS-I bus, and features a speed class rating of V30, which guarantees minimum write speeds of 30 MB/s. Plus a WMC-500 Wide-Mouth EVA Case designed to protect microphones, electronic devices, and accessories from impact, dust, and moisture. Box Contains Zoom H8 8-Input / 12-Track Portable Handy Recorder Zoom XYH-6 - X/Y Microphone Capsule for Zoom H5 and H6 Field Recorders Zoom XYH-6 - X/Y Microphone Capsule for Zoom H5 and H6 Field Recorders 128GB Extreme PRO UHS-I SDXC Memory Card 128GB Extreme PRO UHS-I SDXC Memory Card WMC-500 Wide-Mouth EVA Case WMC-500 Wide-Mouth EVA Case 4 x AA Batteries 4 x AA Batteries Download License for Steinberg Cubase LE Download License for Steinberg Cubase LE Download License for Steinberg WaveLab Cast Download License for Steinberg WaveLab Cast 1-Year Warranty 1-Year Warranty","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YpIcDB2nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zoom","source_asin":"B08GG93GLK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181766","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GG93GLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GG93GLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1181767,"name":"ALEKO CF02 Mini Dashboard Electric Car Fan for Summer Road Trips 6 Inch Blades 12V Aluminum","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JmD1IzsfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Keep cool when you’re on the road with ALEKO’s dashboard car fan. Our fan plugs right into your car’s front DC power outlet with no batteries required, so you can stay cool on road trips without the need to stop at gas stations to recharge. Unlike many clip on car fans, the ALEKO brand fan attaches to your dash, top, or side panel with included screws, so you won’t have to worry about it slipping or falling while in use. 6 inch aluminum blades will keep a refreshing airflow going, and the metal safety grill will prevent accidents while the fan’s in use. Best of all, the fan is on a swivel base and comes with a 7 foot cord, so it can easily reach the back seat or anywhere else in the car that needs to cool off. Try an ALEKO brand car fan on your next road trip, or even just on the drive to work, and you’ll wonder how you ever got on without it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JmD1IzsfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALEKO","source_asin":"B00XOIU18G","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181767","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XOIU18G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XOIU18G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
