window.products.push({"id":1181774,"name":"1PCS Smart Tracker Works with Apple Find My, Super Small Wireless Powerful Item Locator, Remote Keys Finder, Waterproof Tracking Device for Keys, Wall","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Jiz3T7WXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatile Smart Bluetooth Tracker -- The smart keys finder and item locator helps you keep track of your items at any time. Simply attach the smart tracker to everyday things such as keys, bags, wallets, backpacks, suitcases, etc. NOTE: This CozyLife Bluetooth Item locator ONLY supports iOS and is NOT available for Android. Compatible with iPhone/iPod touch models running iOS 14.5 or later, and iPad models running iPad OS 14.5 or later. Find Nearby -- When your wallet has CozyLife Tag attached (which is compatible with Apple Find My), it's not a big deal if you misplace your wallet, phone, bag, keys or other items. Just play a sound on the built-in speaker (100dB volume) or say \"Hey Siri, find my wallet\" and follow the sound to find it. It is so easy and convenient. Anti-Lost Key Finder Locator -- If your CozyLife Smart Tag is lost, you can set it to \"Lost Mode\". You will be automatically notified when a device on the network detects it. Someone can get your contact information by clicking on your CozyLife Tag with an NFC-capable smartphone. Smart key tracker device is a very practical and compact looking gadget in daily life. The key locator is a warm gift for your family, elderly parents or forgetful friends. Find Far Away -- Remote positioning function is not limited by distance. When the luggage tracker locator is not within Bluetooth range of your iPhone, the Find My app will provide you with the latest information about the location of the locator, then you can find it according to the map. To protect your privacy, all communication with Find My network is anonymous and encrypted, and location data and history are not stored on the smart tracker tag. Please don't worry about the privacy leakage. Package Included -- You will get 1pcs mini bluetooth tracker. Size: 5.3*2.8*0.5 cm / 2.1*1.1*0.2 inch. The intelligent GPS tracking device is equipped with CR2032 battery with super long standby time of 8~12 months, which can be easily replaced for long term use. Water-Resistant (IP67 rated). It is a good choice for the item locator or finder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Jiz3T7WXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmaringWing","source_asin":"B0BJ298QHZ","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181774","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ298QHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ298QHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
