window.products.push({"id":1181804,"name":"Key Finder Locator,Key Tracker,RF Item Tag Beeper Alarm Tracking Device with 1 Transmitter and 4 Receivers,Easy to Use,Find My Car Keys,Wallet,TV Remo","category":"electronics","retail price":18.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fj8Zzw0IL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Used to find keys and small items：VODESON item key finder device with 1 rf transmitter remote control (It is also a storage base)and 4 receivers. By pressing the button on the transmitter, the corresponding receiver will make a sound,leading you to track your lost items like keys, car key,wallet, tv remote control, purse, glasses whatever you need to track . No need APP, easy to use：This wireless key finder is very suitable for the elderly people with poor memory and all busy working people. No need to install any APP on your phone,it is easy to operate.The key finder includes 4 CR2032 batteries.It can be used after installing the battery.(Note : 2 x 1.5V AAA batteries for transmitter are not Included.) 2022 new design, more beautiful appearance：This key finder adopts a brand new design. The transmitter can control the receiver and it is also a storage base.The receiver that you don’t use can be placed on the base.When you need to use the transmitter to find items,it can avoid the embarrassing situation of not finding the transmitter.At the same time, our key finder receiver is more rounded and slimmer.Put it in your pocket together with the key, the experience is more comfortable. Better product performance:The sound of the receiver's beeper is75-80DB.This volume can ensure that you hear the sound within 50 feet.If not, you can move and keep pressing the transmitter button until you find the items.Adopt 433.92MHZ wireless rf technology ,signals can penetrate walls, doors, cushions etc.Working distance is 50-100 feet.The standby time of the receiver is generally about 6 months,and the transmitter’s standby time is 1 year or more. Best gift for seniors and forgetful people :VODESON is a manufacturer specializing in the key finders.This key finder is a very useful and novel product,not only can help you solve the trouble of finding things. It can be used as a gift for your dear family and friends.Gifts for Father's Day, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Easter, Halloween, Birthday etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fj8Zzw0IL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYLAIM","source_asin":"B09SD6HJ1R","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181804","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SD6HJ1R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SD6HJ1R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1181805,"name":"RCA F27615 27\" TV","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R7MP7G8ZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description w/Guide Plus, sound logic Amazon.com With this advanced RCA TV set, you'll never again have to scramble to find a copy of TV Guide or your local newspaper to find out what's on. Summaries and times of all programs are instantly accessible with the touch of a remote-control button. This free, easy-to-use TV programming service, \"GUIDE Plus GOLD\", allows you to view listings up to 48 hours in advance. Find a program you like and access it via one-touch tuning by navigating to your desired program in the on-screen guide. The same feature can work in sync with your VCR to enable simple recording of your favorite shows. In addition, we liked some of the other built-in features, such as Parent Control. This unit's V-Chip technology, allows parents to block out all programming within a specific television industry rating. For example, you can choose to filter out all TV-MA (for mature audiences only) programming, and your TV will display a black screen in place of the scheduled programs. While there is no way to prevent the broadcasters from airing long commercials, this RCA TV offers another option. Commercial-skip is a feature that allows you to surf through other channels for the duration of the commercial break. To enable it, simply press the commercial-skip button on your remote once for each 30 seconds of desired surfing time. When your time runs out, the TV automatically tunes back in to your original program so that you don't miss a second. Of course, the drawback to this feature is that you must correctly estimate the length of the commercial break. Despite its imperfection, we found ourselves frequently using commercial-skip to bypass annoying ads. Pros: Built-in GUIDE Plus GOLD Built-in GUIDE Plus GOLD Good picture, reasonable price Good picture, reasonable price Parental Control built in Cons: Commercial-skip feature could use some improvement Parental Control built in Cons: Commercial-skip feature could use some improvement Commercial-skip feature could use some improvement","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R7MP7G8ZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RCA","source_asin":"B00000IZZY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181805","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00000IZZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00000IZZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
