window.products.push({"id":1181866,"name":"HDMI Switch with Remote - HDMI Switcher 5 in 1 Out, 4K HDMI Switch Box, Multiple HDMI Port for TV, 5 HDMI 1.4 Port, Support 4K@30Hz, 3D Audio Video Sy","category":"electronics","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YugEmzuTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HDMI Switcher 5 In 1 Out: 4K HDMI switch box enables you to stream video and audio from 5 HDMI devices to 1 HDMI display(Monitor, UHD Monitor, Smart TV, Projector etc..). Our HDMI switch 5 port has two ways to switch, manual switch and remote control. You never need to plug out and unplug in HDMI cables again. Now you can change between TV shows, work or play video games between 5 devices easily. Remote Control: Comes with an IR remote control making it easier to control, you can still switch manually also. This HDMI switch with remote allows you to smoothly swap HDMI inputs from your couch or bed from up to 15 ft. We understand getting up from the couch and bed is painful when you are comfortable in it. Note: When the remote control is in use, the infrared receiver needs to be connected and it should be directly facing the receiver without any objects in the way. 4K@30Hz UHD Resolution: This 5 Port HDMI switch 4k hub supports 3840*2160/30Hz 1080P/60Hz video, supports audio DTS-HD, Dolby-ture HD, Dolby-AC3, DSD, HDCP. 3D audio and video synchronization, no delay, no flicker. Wide Compatibility: HDMI Switcher 5x1 supports HDMI standard sources such as TV, Roku, Stick/Fire Stick, PS5/PS4/PS3, Xbox, Nintendo Switch, Laptop/PC, Blu-Ray and DVD players, HD-Ready, Full HD TVs, monitors, projectors and other HDMI-enabled devices. Metal case and heat dissipation: Signal safety. Plug and play, no software required. For good transmission, use a high-quality HDMI cable less than 66 feet. This 5 way HDMI Switch is ideal for group meetings, advertising, office, multimedia, learning, financial securities, presentations, video teaching, police surveillance, video broadcasting systems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YugEmzuTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DiamondTiger","source_asin":"B0BWHQ6Y98","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181866","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWHQ6Y98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWHQ6Y98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
