window.products.push({"id":1181897,"name":"Aneew 16GB Wood Black Pendrive Wooden 3D International Chess USB Flash Drive","category":"electronics","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KAobnDjwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"16GB Pendrive 2.0 Black Cool Wooden 3D International Chess Model USB Flash Drive Memory Thumb Stick Gift Feature: 100% brand new and high quality Capacity：16GB Model: International Chess model Color: Black Style: Cool Reading Speed: >10MB/S Writing Speed: >4MB/S Compatibility: Supports Windows 10, Windows 8, Windows 7, Vista, ME, XP, NT Linux, and Mac OS. Funny Gift for Youself/Friends/Family/Teachers/Classmates. Note: Question:About why the USB flash drive real capacity is not the correct capacity? Answer:Flash memory vendors are using decimal arithmetic: 1MB = 1000KB,1G = 1000MB calculated, the operating system using binary arithmetic: 1MB = 1024KB,1GB = 1024MB So there are some differences between display capacity and nominal capacity of flash memory product. Package include: 1x USB Flash Drive To Dear Buyer: 1. Welcome to Aneew's shop.We mainly sell gift-type cartoon USB flash drives,stationery,key chains and simulated baits. 2. If you have any problem before or after payment, please feel free to contact us, we will reply you in the first time. 3. Hope you can enjoy shopping from us. Thanks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KAobnDjwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aneew","source_asin":"B06XSGGVW7","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181897","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XSGGVW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XSGGVW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
