window.products.push({"id":1181900,"name":"Panasonic KX-TG2621W 2.4 GHz FHSS GigaRange Digital Cordless Telephone","category":"electronics","retail price":58.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413NP73Y6AL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The KX-TG2621W utilizes 2.4 GHz bandwidth, providing your calls with improved security and reduced interference compared to 900 MHz signal transmission. The system also makes use of frequency-hopping digital spread spectrum technology, so it constantly \"hops\" through available channels to maintain a clear connection. Silent Call Indicator Coordinates with Caller ID This system offers a shorter handset antenna than previous models while still maintaining the long range that Panasonic customers have become accustomed to. But what's even cooler is that the base of the antenna-which lights up-will alert you to an incoming call. Select from blue, green, amber or multi-color options. With Light-Up ID (requires subscription to local Caller ID service), you can choose a light-up indicator color, blue, green, amber or multi-color, to link to your preprogrammed phone book data. The light-up indicator will flash quickly to show that you have an incoming call, and it will flash slowly to let you know you have a new message in your voice mailbox (with subscription to a phone company voice mail service). So turn off the ringer, let the kids sleep, and never miss a call. Put the Phone Down While You Talk When you've been on hold for ten minutes, do you really need to hold the phone? Not with the handset speakerphone. Just listen along, and press a button or pick up when it's convenient. You'll think up other great uses, like letting Grandma and Grandpa listen to their new grandchild at the same time, painting your nails as you talk to your best friend, or just being able to set the phone down while you talk. What's in the Box: Base, cordless handset, AC adapter, telephone line, handset battery, user's guide, warranty card","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413NP73Y6AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panasonic","source_asin":"B000F8J396","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181900","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000F8J396","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000F8J396","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
