window.products.push({"id":1181989,"name":"Creative EP-3NC In-Ear Noise Cancelling Headphones (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MlBrAISmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Designed for the busy commuters who seek peace and solace in an increasingly crowded environment, the new Creative EP-3NC is a pair of active noise-canceling earphones that measures external ambient noise, using active noise-cancellation circuitry with its built-in microphone and synthesizes with a sound in the opposite phase to reduce significant background noise by up to 90%. Its ergonomic in-ear design with soft silicone eartips provide excellent noise-isolation, offering crystal clear playback with deep bass for use with all digital devices. The convenient built-in monitor function on the dongle lets you hear surrounding sounds whenever you need, without having to take off your earphones. From the Manufacturer From Creative, the sleek EP-3NC In-Ear Noise-Cancelling Headphones feature an advanced active circuitry that works to cancel out background noises and ensure a pristine listening experience--no matter where you are. An ideal pick for commuters, the EP-3NC's ergonomic in-ear design and specially engineered drivers deliver clear, detailed playback with deep bass. Featuring a built-in monitor that allows you to hear surrounding sounds without removing the headphones, the EP-3NC also come with an airplane adapter and travel pouch. Creative EP-3NC In-Ear Noise-Cancelling Headphones (Black) Active noise isolation neutralizes loud ambient noise Active noise isolation neutralizes loud ambient noise Improved clarity with 9-millimeter Neodymium magnet drivers Improved clarity with 9-millimeter Neodymium magnet drivers Elegant, ergonomic in-ear design Elegant, ergonomic in-ear design Three sizes of soft, silicon ear tips for custom comfort Three sizes of soft, silicon ear tips for custom comfort Travel-ready with storage pouch and airplane adapter Travel-ready with storage pouch and airplane adapter With the included travel pouch and airplane adapter, the headphones are ideal for commuters. Active noise isolation neutralizes up to 90 percent of background noise. Active Noise Isolation for a Pristine Audio Experience Built to deliver a pristine listening experience whether you're in the quiet of your own home or on a subway car at rush hour, the Creative EP-3NC In-Ear Noise-Cancelling Headphones utilize advanced, active noise-isolation technology. A built-in microphone picks up ambient noise, which is measured by the noise-isolation circuitry. The circuitry then creates an equal but opposite sound wave, effectively neutralizing up to 90 percent of background noise, even in the loudest environments. In addition, a convenient built-in monitor function allows you to hear surrounding sounds whenever you need to, without taking off your earphones. And a single \"AAA\" battery provides up to 100 hours of noise isolation, so you won't have to change batteries often. Dynamic Neodymium Drivers for Clear Transmission Specially engineered, high-quality, 9-millimeter Neodymium magnetic drivers power the EP-3NC's incredible sound. No matter what your favorite music genre is, these headphones offer optimum performance with deep bass and balanced tones. In addition, the EP-3NC's 1.3-meter, oxygen-free copper cable and gold-plated plug provide uninterrupted voice and music transmission from your favorite player to the headphones. The high, overall quality of this audio experience is ideal for digital music playback and fatigue-free, long-term listening. Comfortable, Ergonomic Design For a crisp, fulfilling audio experience wherever you are, the EP-3NC's ergonomic in-ear design provides passive noise isolation for reduced background noise when active noise isolation is turned off--no battery required. And because comfort is essential to enjoying high-quality audio, each pair of headphones comes with three sets of soft silicone ear tips, so you can select the size that best fits your ears. The Creative EP-3NC In-Ear Noise-Cancelling Headphones come with a travel pouch and an airplane adapter, and they are backed by a one-year limited warranty. What's in the Box Creative EP-3NC In-Ear Noise-Cancelling Headphones in black, one \"AAA\" alkaline battery, silicone ear tips in three sizes, airplane adapter, and travel pouch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31MlBrAISmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Labs","source_asin":"B0035MDZKM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1181989","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0035MDZKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0035MDZKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
